  "story": {
    "title": "Aiman's School Bag",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Aiman is a young girl. I am Aiman’s school bag. I am her friend. She wakes up in the morning and gets ready for school.",
      "I watch her from my place in the corner of the room. I feel happy that I will also be going out soon.",
      "Aiman carries me on her back when she leaves for school every morning. When she walks fast, my heart beats fast too.",
      "I ride on her back till we are out on the street. In the school bus, I sit comfortably on her lap. Aiman just loves me.",
      "I meet many other bags on our way to school. We chat, sing and reach school, jumping and running along with the children.",
      "Aiman keeps many things inside me: colourful books, note books, eraser, pencils and her lunch box too. The lovely smell of food comes from her lunch box.",
      "All these things get tossed around inside me. Aiman keeps jumping with me on her back. She runs up and down. I am always with her.",
      "During the lunch break, she leaves me in the classroom. I feel lonely but then, there are many other bags in the room. We all chat, laugh and sing but I miss Aiman.",
      "When school is over, do you know what Aiman does? Oof, she quickly stuffs all her things into me! She wants to reach home as quickly as possible. I start panting because she runs very fast towards the bus.",
      "She puts me in a corner after reaching home and forgets all about me. I watch her from a distance.",
      "As Aiman is growing up, my weight is also growing. She finds it difficult to carry me on her back now. Can someone make our burden lighter?"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Aiman is a young girl.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Aiman là một cô bé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I am Aiman’s school bag.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tớ là cặp sách của Aiman."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I am her friend.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tớ là bạn của cô bé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She wakes up in the morning and gets ready for school.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Buổi sáng, cô bé thức dậy và chuẩn bị đi học."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I watch her from my place in the corner of the room.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tớ nhìn cô bé từ chỗ của tớ ở góc phòng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I feel happy that I will also be going out soon.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tớ thấy vui vì tớ cũng sắp được ra ngoài rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Aiman carries me on her back when she leaves for school every morning.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sáng nào Aiman cũng đeo tớ trên lưng khi cô bé đi học."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When she walks fast, my heart beats fast too.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi cô bé đi nhanh, tim tớ cũng đập nhanh theo."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I ride on her back till we are out on the street.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tớ được đeo trên lưng cô bé cho đến khi chúng tớ ra ngoài đường."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "In the school bus, I sit comfortably on her lap.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trên xe buýt đi học, tớ ngồi thoải mái trên đùi cô bé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Aiman just loves me.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Aiman rất yêu tớ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I meet many other bags on our way to school.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trên đường đến trường, tớ gặp nhiều chiếc cặp khác."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "We chat, sing and reach school, jumping and running along with the children.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tớ trò chuyện, hát hò và đến trường, cùng nhảy nhót và chạy với các bạn nhỏ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Aiman keeps many things inside me: colourful books, note books, eraser, pencils and her lunch box too.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Aiman để nhiều thứ vào trong tớ: sách màu sắc, vở, cục tẩy, bút chì và cả hộp cơm trưa của cô bé nữa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The lovely smell of food comes from her lunch box.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mùi thức ăn thơm ngon tỏa ra từ hộp cơm trưa của cô bé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "All these things get tossed around inside me.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tất cả những thứ này bị xóc nảy lung tung bên trong tớ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Aiman keeps jumping with me on her back.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Aiman cứ nhảy nhót với tớ trên lưng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She runs up and down.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé chạy lên chạy xuống."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I am always with her.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tớ luôn ở bên cô bé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "During the lunch break, she leaves me in the classroom.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trong giờ nghỉ trưa, cô bé để tớ lại trong lớp học."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I feel lonely but then, there are many other bags in the room.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tớ cảm thấy cô đơn nhưng rồi, có nhiều chiếc cặp khác trong phòng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "We all chat, laugh and sing but I miss Aiman.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tớ đều trò chuyện, cười đùa và hát nhưng tớ nhớ Aiman."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When school is over, do you know what Aiman does?",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi tan học, bạn có biết Aiman làm gì không?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Oof, she quickly stuffs all her things into me!",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ôi, cô bé nhanh chóng nhét tất cả đồ đạc vào trong tớ!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She wants to reach home as quickly as possible.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé muốn về nhà nhanh nhất có thể."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I start panting because she runs very fast towards the bus.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tớ bắt đầu thở hổn hển vì cô bé chạy rất nhanh về phía xe buýt."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She puts me in a corner after reaching home and forgets all about me.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau khi về nhà, cô bé đặt tớ vào một góc và quên béng tớ đi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I watch her from a distance.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_027.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tớ nhìn cô bé từ xa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "As Aiman is growing up, my weight is also growing.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_028.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi Aiman lớn lên, cân nặng của tớ cũng tăng theo."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She finds it difficult to carry me on her back now.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_029.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Giờ đây, cô bé thấy khó khăn khi đeo tớ trên lưng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Can someone make our burden lighter?",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_12012/s_030.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ai đó có thể làm gánh nặng của chúng tớ nhẹ hơn không?"
      }
    ]
  },
